      <definition>[Ch. kung] n. A feudal title roughly equivalent to duke or count.</definition>
      <page>391</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠤᠯᠤᠰ ᠎ᠲᠤᠷ ᠲᠤᠰᠠᠯᠠᠬᠤ ᠭᠥᠩ</unicode>
          <transcript>ulus tur tusalaxu - -</transcript>
          <definition>Imperial Duke of the second degree (Ch. fu-kuo-kung).</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠤᠯᠤᠰ ᠤᠨ ᠲᠦᠰᠢᠶ᠎ᠡ ᠭᠥᠩ</unicode>
